━━━ stdout
List skills from the opentidehq/skills catalogue.

Usage: opentide setup skills discover [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -C, --path <PATH_FLAG>
          Repository path
          
          [default: .]

  -q, --query <QUERY>
          Keep skills whose name, slug or description holds this text

      --installed
          Keep only the skills installed in .agents/skills/

      --refresh
          Fetch the catalogue again, not the in-process copy of the last 30s

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide setup skills discover --query sigma

━━━ stderr · empty
